["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nik Storonsky: The most uncompromising banking CEO K-factor NPAP (New Product Approval Process) OCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cheekypint-revolut-ceo-把银行信贷类比卖期权-收十年租金-一年亏光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d2ccbd206c41a7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Revolut CEO 把銀行信貸類比賣期權：收十年租金，一年虧光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸利潤會被經濟週期一次性抹平，所以 Revolut 把放貸目標壓到資產負債表不到10%、其餘證券化出表，寧可做訂閱制科技公司，也不做傳統淨息差銀行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新型銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">產品運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadi Hamid and Matthew Kaemingk on Whether Democracy Needs Religion idolatry political hobbyism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-goodfight-政治变得越世俗-反而越像一场圣战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>政治變得越世俗，反而越像一場聖戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位作者認為，當人們不再從宗教獲得身份認同與終極意義，這種渴望並未消失，而是轉移進了政治——這正是美國政治走向「聖戰化」的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教與政治</span><span class=\"tag\">政黨政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Elon Musk Solves Problems | Jon McNeill battlefield promotion bill of materials weighted ETF Follow Me Home exercise Fire Yourself exercise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-knowledge-马斯克的产品算法-自动化是最后一步-不是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/586a4f39f9c67632-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克的產品算法：自動化是最後一步，不是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉團隊曾因為先自動化而在同一個問題上卡住數月：馬斯克的算法要求先刪需求、簡化流程、手動跑通，自動化永遠是最後一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span><span class=\"tag\">馬斯克</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"515 從鐵幕創作到解凍文藝：漫談世界電影史中的波蘭巨匠安傑伊·瓦伊達 Zespół filmowy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cn2aa250-波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的-没进戛纳就等于没拍过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>波蘭電影史其實是電影節寫出來的：沒進戛納就等於沒拍過</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者說大衛·波德威爾寫羅馬尼亞電影史時一個字都沒提，不是因為片子差，而是因為那些片子從沒被送到西方能看見的電影節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">波蘭電影</span><span class=\"tag\">冷戰文化政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Perfectly Leveraged for the Squat progressive overload majestic womanhood manhood stones Title IX\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-ninepi-被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星-当年体重大才被认为又强又美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>被遺忘的維多利亞大力女明星：當年體重大才被認為又強又美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現代人以瘦為美的觀念只有一百多年歷史——維多利亞時代的馬戲團大力女星體重兩百磅，卻被封為「世界上最強壯也最美麗的女人」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性力量史</span><span class=\"tag\">舉重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How college football&#x27;s deadliest year built the NCAA flying wedge mass momentum play NIL death harvest\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-throughline-老罗斯福不是ncaa诞生的真正推手-一场校园死亡才是导火索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>老羅斯福不是NCAA誕生的真正推手，一場校園死亡才是導火索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1905年「死亡豐收年」後，真正催生NCAA新規則委員會的不是老羅斯福的三校會議，而是NYU校長繞開大三校另起爐灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育史</span><span class=\"tag\">NCAA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 227 Carbon Monoxide: Haunted houses &amp; coal mine canaries carboxyhemoglobin hyperbaric oxygen\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-tpwky-历史上许多-闹鬼事件-其实是一氧化碳中毒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>歷史上許多「鬧鬼事件」,其實是一氧化碳中毒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一氧化碳不僅搶著跟血紅蛋白結合，還讓已經結合的氧氣釋放不出來——這種雙重機制造成的症狀太詭異，歷史上常被診斷成鬧鬼或精神病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">毒理學</span><span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"297: Why Teens Lie—and How to Respond Without Escalating Haim Ginott smell test perspective game\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-asklisa-心理学家-教孩子对同伴撒谎自保-好过逞强说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fae74bb25cb36023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>心理學家：教孩子對同伴撒謊自保，好過逞強說真話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">面對同伴慫恿抽大麻之類的場合，她寧可教孩子說一句謊把責任推給父母脫身，也不要孩子因找不到體面拒絕方式而冒險——目標是安全優先，不是誠實至上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年教育</span><span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loud, Messy, Physical - What To Do When Kids Won&#x27;t Stop Fighting\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-unruffled-孩子打架别急着拉开-冲突本身就是他们在学社交/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架別急著拉開：衝突本身就是他們在學社交</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">頻繁的尖叫、撕咬甚至打你一巴掌，往往不是孩子出了問題，而是父母越介入，衝突就越容易變成孩子們搶奪「媽媽注意力」的戲碼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">手足衝突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258｜聊聊硅谷創業“修道院”HF0與OpenRouter早期故事 spray and pray subtraction Demo Dinner unified interface for LLMs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-sv101-以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客-学到的却是只做一件事的减法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">54:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>以為硅谷孵化器教的是增長黑客，學到的卻是只做一件事的減法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人說最難的減法不是去掉不重要的娛樂，而是只盯住對公司最重要的那件事，甚至排除掉第二重要的事情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">HF0</span><span class=\"tag\">孵化器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"151 ✪ 從「需要」到「想要」：中國時尚品牌集體向上 lookbook intangible assets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-fengtouquan-消费降级论被打脸-千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>消費降級論被打臉：千元檔國貨時尚品牌增速是大盤六倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天貓數據顯示，客單價1500至2000元的輕奢價位國貨品牌，今年成交增速是整個服裝電商大盤的六倍，消費者正在為嚮往感而非性價比買單。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">時尚品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">電商經營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"512 – Oops, All Henrys exchequer investiture controversy homage mark\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-britishhist-把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝-英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>把6歲女兒嫁給未來皇帝：英格蘭國庫的第一筆開支是聯姻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利把6歲的女兒許配給靠軟禁父親上位的德意志國王，為此開出的一萬馬克聘金，與魯弗斯當年賣掉整個諾曼底公國的價碼完全相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">王室聯姻</span><span class=\"tag\">封建效忠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen and His Spy Romeo Entity List\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控-仍放行48亿美元芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19b361072bd3e2fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>商務部明知英偉達合作方由中國間諜操控，仍放行48億美元芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商務部早已掌握Megaspeed由中國間諜運營的情報，仍選擇不執行本可阻斷其芯片供應的既有規定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Frontier Labs Buy: A Data Deep Dive with Handshake AI — Garrett Lord &amp; Team RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) reward hacking redlining Care Bench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-latentspace-银行家宁可从零重做-也不愿修改ai给出的95-正确答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1b6b68e7fa0afc2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>銀行家寧可從零重做，也不願修改AI給出的95%正確答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修復一個95%正確的AI輸出，花的時間和從零開始一樣多，因為錯誤藏在公式與判斷的細節裡，而非表層格式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據標註</span><span class=\"tag\">金融建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anne of Brittany proxy marriage book of hours Estates of Brittany\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-stuffmissed-安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国-死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>安妮公爵夫人三次聯姻周旋法國，死後十八年布列塔尼還是被吞併</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安妮一生三次嫁人、兩次加冕法國王后，用婚姻條款逼法國承認布列塔尼的獨立地位，但她死後國王還是違揹她的遺願，把布列塔尼併入了法國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治聯姻</span><span class=\"tag\">布列塔尼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Kupor on Building a16z and Rebuilding the Federal Workforce OPM GS-14 permissioned risk time-in-grade phalanx\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-a16z-美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>美國政府退休審批最後一步是郵寄進賓州一座地下礦洞人工翻檔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">退休申請走完所有流程後，紙質件要被送進賓夕法尼亞一座廢棄石灰岩礦洞人工歸檔——卡住它的不是技術，是沒人願意為改善系統去承擔被國會問責的風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Retelling history in art and drama Joint Stock corpsing Boko Haram\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-startweek-今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守-不是更开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>今天的英國劇場比1970年代更保守，不是更開放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《雲的九種形態》導演坦言：如今英國新劇遠比1970年代更拘謹，復排時特意將後半段處理成一齣年代戲，因為那種坦率尺度已經回不去了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殖民歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">戲劇改編</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"宏觀經濟如何傳導給我們每個人？ R&lt;G convenience yield paradox of thrift negative beta\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-mianji-这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题-根源是ai资本开支狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df0264fae5d8abe9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>這輪全球失衡不是宏觀問題，根源是AI資本開支狂潮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國擴大AI資本開支推高投資、股市繁榮拉動消費，儲蓄降、投資升，這才是本輪全球失衡加劇的真正驅動力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">美債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"This Is How New York City Takes Out Its Trash Empire bin ASL truck Defensible Space\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-oddlots-纽约收垃圾没有现成卡车可用-政府花10个月自己设计了一辆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>紐約收垃圾沒有現成卡車可用：政府花10個月自己設計了一輛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為沒有適合紐約街道的自動側裝卡車，抄歐洲方案又要等五年，紐約市環衛局乾脆親自下場把車設計出來，只用了十個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市治理</span><span class=\"tag\">垃圾處理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#415 ‒ AMA #91: Understanding lab testing: what blood work can and cannot tell you about your health and disease risk DTC testing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-thepeterattiad-血检再全面-也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>血檢再全面，也只能揭示兩到三成的健康風險全貌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peter Attia在這期AMA裡給出一個具體數字：即便是最全面的血液檢測，也只能提供他評估患者風險所需信息的25%到30%，剩下的需要靠影像、體成分和縱向追蹤補齊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">血液檢測</span><span class=\"tag\">健康風險評估</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are We Cooking!? What Should Dems Do Next + Jensen&#x27;s Affair MSS MATCH Act Section 232 USMCA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-得州州长选举爆冷-反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ba219ec92b9bc66-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>得州州長選舉爆冷，反數據中心情緒一夜抹去近萬億美元市值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反數據中心情緒從來不是「自由派恨科技」的故事，而是跨黨派共識，已經強到能掀翻一場州長選舉、讓華爾街措手不及地蒸發鉅額市值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">中期選舉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Deep Dive on Submarines X-Craft bathyscaphe SSN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-historyhit-击沉贝尔格拉诺号前-副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6775897482174464-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">51:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>擊沉貝爾格拉諾號前，副艇長曾當眾喝止艇長的開火令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">核潛艇「征服者」號擊沉阿根廷巡洋艦貝爾格拉諾號前，副指揮官麥克萊蒙曾在控制室喝止艇長，只為等一個更好的射擊角度——那是英國潛艇自二戰以來首次真正開火。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">潛艇史</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰海戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"721. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Outbreak of The Crimean War (Part 1) sublime port plunger cavalry drawl black bottle affair sick man of Europe\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-restishistory-克里米亚战争真正的导火索-只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/607aa1e9567d043b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>克里米亞戰爭真正的導火索，只是伯利恆教堂一把鑰匙的歸屬之爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">克里米亞戰爭由伯利恆教堂一把鑰匙的歸屬之爭點燃，英法俄三大國在互相猜忌和誤判中，像後來的一戰列強一樣夢遊般捲入了這場衝突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亞戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">維多利亞時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Cisco Got Bullwhipped Bullwhip effect Virtual close Extranet Keiretsu Vendor financing Contract manufacturer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-asianometry-思科自夸能实时看清全球需求-其实看到的是客户重复下的订单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">31:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>思科自誇能實時看清全球需求，其實看到的是客戶重複下的訂單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">思科兩個季度庫存分別暴漲87%和58.8%，根源不是需求爆發，而是客戶為搶缺貨重複下單，又被「實時供應鏈」原樣放大轉發給了上游。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">供應鏈管理</span><span class=\"tag\">牛鞭效應</span>\n</div></div></a>"]